  "next_id": 37,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -30,
        -26
      ],
      "id": 16,
      "text": "ATmega328P at the factory clock (1 MHz) with avr328_wake, asleep in power-down almost all the time:\nthe watchdog's interrupt wakes it every second and toggles the LED on PB5; SW1 (PD4) wakes it through\nthe pin change interrupt and toggles PB4 on each press; holding SW2 (INT0, PD2, low level) wakes it\nand lights PB3. The probe on PB5 shows the watchdog's period (1.024 s at 128 kHz)."
    }
  ],
